   "subject": "Documentation on including custom htmlwidgets and or javascript plugins in shinyapps.io",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I am new to shiny, <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361137256000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZJVgbPTWPjVRjhorq6uCR\">shinyapps.io</a>, and javascript so please excuse me. I have spent several days trying to determine if I can include custom made htmlwidgets for R or use javascript and javascript plugins in <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361137256000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZJVgbPTWPjVRjhorq6uCR\">shinyapps.io</a>. For example, is it possible to include a <span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">JQuery multiselect plugin (</span><a href=\"https://github.com/davidstutz/bootstrap-multiselect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/davidstutz/bootstrap-multiselect&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361137256000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qbSvx2uqylhcA3n1c1f0S\">https://github.com/davidstutz/bootstrap-multiselect</a>) in <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361137256000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZJVgbPTWPjVRjhorq6uCR\">shinyapps.io</a>. This type of functionality would be key to some dashboards I wish to work on.  I went through the tutorial  <font size=\"2\">&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">How to build a JavaScript based widget&quot; at </span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/js-lesson1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/js-lesson1/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361137256000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0oqQnaLTimscoY8YJ9NGvY\">http://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/js-lesson1/</a> but it is unclear to me that I can use this in <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361137256000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZJVgbPTWPjVRjhorq6uCR\">shinyapps.io</a>. Also, I am not sure how/if I can use javascript plugins. </font>Anything to help me further in this journey will be much appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Scott</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "M-OQ8nSZAwAJ",
   "from": "Andy Kipp",
