   "subject": "Re: [shinyapps-users] Documentation on including custom htmlwidgets and or javascript plugins in shinyapps.io",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>There isn&#39;t really any reason why a custom htmlwidget would not work on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361137258000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DN0RuNZQ-I97LswfQqYs_\">shinyapps.io</a>. If you put your custom widget (package) on GitHub, <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361137258000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DN0RuNZQ-I97LswfQqYs_\">shinyapps.io</a> will be able to use it.</div><div><br></div><div>Hope that helps,</div><div>-Andy</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
